apply_name(0x102768E0, 'sqgxContext_Dump', "The single richest field-name harvest in this project: reveals the complete GPU-facing render context by real name -- camera/projection/light matrices, 8 hardware lights, a material 'metal' parameter, motion blur (motionBlurSize), glow (glowData/glowDataExtra), refraction (index/UV offset/texture ID), bump depth, real shadow parameters (shadowBlendFlag/shadowVolumeExtend/shadowW), and the actual vertex/index/normal/UV/color GPU buffer handles. Confirms BRDF and AmbientMap are explicitly printed as 'not implemented' -- those two sqShader files exist but their features are inert stubs in this shipped build.", True)
