apply_name(0x1027B650, 'sqskSkeleton_Dump', "Real, complete field layout confirmed via this function's own dump labels: type (+0), root node (+28), node array (+32), joint array (+36), numBones (+40). Critically confirms sqskJoint's real struct size is exactly 156 bytes (iterates the joint array with a 156-byte stride per entry) -- matching sqskJoint_Dump's confirmed fields (through offset 152) plus alignment exactly. Direct, complete confirmation: a skeleton is a numBones-sized array of 156-byte joints -- the real sqSkeleton structure behind CYySkl, previously only inferred structurally.", True)
