apply_name(0x10290FC0, 'sqsdGeneric_BakeOntoShape', "Confirmed: uses the SAME 655369 magic-number cache tag as sqsdGlow_BakeOntoShape -- all shader types that cache, cache via one unified convention. Builds a real feature bitmask (bump=1, env=4, phong=2) from what the model actually has, logging real 'Model is missing...' errors if a requested feature lacks its data. Passes the combined bitmask to sqgxContext_SelectShaderMode -- a real shader-permutation system. Also references a real 'Spherigon' warning (curved-surface normal interpolation, a known period rendering technique).", True)
