apply_name(0x10291C60, 'sqhiNode_Dump', "CORRECTED from sqskNode_Dump (was misattributed to sqSkeleton) after this function's own debug string ('sqhiNode <%x>') definitively confirmed it belongs to sqHierarchy. Real, complete structure: a genuine left-child/right-sibling tree node -- parent, leftChild, sibling. Also: type, modelIndex, dirty, doBlur (a per-node motion-blur toggle -- directly relevant to VFX), an embedded matrix, and a separate xform pointer (connects to sqXform). Recursively dumps children and siblings. sqSkeleton's joints reference these via sqskSkeleton_GetNodeByIndex.", True)
