apply_name(0x10295120, 'sqmoMixerMotion_Sample', "The real evaluation function completing the sqmoMixerMotion_SetEntrySize finding: validates each input motion's type tag, and recursively resolves nested motions -- an input to a mixer can itself be another mixer. The real, confirmed mechanism most likely underlying CYyMoveBlendQue/CYyBlendQue's blending behavior.", True)
