apply_name(0x102958B0, 'sqmoKeyChannel_Dump', "Real field layout confirmed via this function's own dump labels: type (+0), entrySize (+28 -- matching the exact field name already seen in sqmoMixerMotion's error strings), timeSpan (+32, float), numKeys (+40), interpolation (+36, enum: 1=Linear, 2=Smooth, else=None). 'Linear' directly confirms the mode Quat_NLerp (0x10033220) implements. 'Smooth' is a second, different interpolation mode -- checked thoroughly (twice) and NOT found anywhere in this build's reachable code; likely unused in this retail build despite existing in the data format. Also confirms the real per-keyframe format: (time float, entrySize data floats) pairs, matching SampleAnimationTrack_Live/_ToBuffer's confirmed structure.", True)
