apply_name(0x1029D710, 'sqsdShader_ParseScript', 'CAPSTONE FINDING for sqShader: a complete text-based shader script parser (uses sqScript_ReadToken/sqScript_TokenEquals), confirming shaders are authored as text scripts, not binary data. Dispatches on a type tag to parse a full, real, distinct keyword-based parameter set per shader type: Generic (bump/env/phong mapping, refraction, 20+ params), Sampling (base properties + up to 16 diffusecolors), Glow (rgb/intensity/sharp/cull -- matches sqsdGlow_Dump exactly), Cartoon (outlinetexture + shadetexture -- cel-shading), Aniso (anisotexture + mode -- brushed-metal/hair style). Also supports a real shader-inheritance mechanism: referencing an existing shader as a template before applying overrides.', True)
