apply_name(0x100A4CE0, 'CXiCollisionActor_IsBlendNormal', 'CXiCollisionActor\'s own single new vtable slot beyond CXiControlActor (256 vs 255 total). Both platforms implement it as a genuine empty stub returning false; confirmed as the correct match because it is the only new slot either platform adds at this exact position, not shape alone.', True)
apply_name(0x100343C0, 'CXiSkeletonActor_PoseCompose', 'The real pose composer -- previously only partially traced. Confirmed as one continuous 100-instruction function: reads only the parent-index byte from each 30-byte CYySkl record (the other 29 bytes are never read at all), then composes each bone\'s transform from a separate 64-byte-stride array via 4 real helper calls per bone, one of which (0x10027D10) is a confirmed real 4x4-matrix-shaped multiply-accumulate. Also contains a confirmed override/exception mechanism: a lookup table at 0x1045EC28 marks specific bone indices as already-handled, skipping the normal composition step for them.', True)

