apply_name(0x1000BF30, 'CDx_SetLight', "device->SetLight. 34 callers. CORRECTED and fully resolved (was named RenderCommand_ValidateAndDispatch on a guess). This is D3D's real light-setting pipeline. Validates a light entry from g_lightTable against the real D3D8 D3DLIGHTTYPE enum exactly: tag 1 (D3DLIGHT_POINT) requires Range/Falloff >= 0, tag 3 (D3DLIGHT_DIRECTIONAL) requires a non-zero Direction vector. Rejects with the real D3DERR_INVALIDCALL HRESULT (0x8876086C) on failure -- verified precisely. On success, calls Light_ApplyTimeOfDayTint, then dispatches to the real device SetLight-equivalent virtual call (vtable offset 0xB0).", True)
