apply_name(0x10010D20, 'App_InitScene', 'Scene/app init: creates every render target (scene A/B CAcc2 @CDx+0x190, 256x256 CAcc @CDx+0x1BC, menu-resolution CAcc @CDx+0x1DC, half-res feedback textures), the task/resource/texture managers, and the actor draw lists. Also the state-0 frame path.', True)
